  "title": "No One Eats Alone - Sandy Hook Promise | Centene Foundation",
  "description": "Centene Foundation sponsors No One Eats Alone to support children through strong community-based programs and to make a positive difference in the lives of children across the nation. Three million students participated in program activities in 2026 that teach them about social isolation and how to make their school more welcoming and accepting for everyone. ",
